{"sha": "be97dafa38a74abefea4de7135039f5d8555afecb3b18dd0f40b878cce39e5fe", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:rlc-oscillations} 章 --- 自由电振荡：RLC}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:1}", "(a) $\\sqrt{LC} = \\qty{1.0e-4}{s}$: $T_0 = \\qty{0.63}{ms}$,", "$f_0 \\approx \\qty{1.6}{kHz}$. (b) $\\sqrt{LC} = \\qty{3.16e-7}{s}$:", "$T_0 = \\qty{2.0}{\\micro s}$，$f_0 \\approx \\qty{0.50}{MHz}$ --- 相差", "$\\sqrt{10^5} \\approx 316$ 倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:2}", "$LC$: $(\\unit{V.s/A})(\\unit{C/V}) = \\unit{s} \\times \\unit{C/A} =", "\\unit{s} \\times \\unit{s} = \\unit{s^2}$，故 $\\sqrt{LC}$ 以秒为单位。", "$2\\pi$ 是纯数 --- 没有量纲需要改变。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:3}", "$Q_0 = CU_0 = \\qty{2.8}{\\micro C}$; $E = \\tfrac12 CU_0^2 =", "\\tfrac12 \\times \\num{4.7e-7} \\times 36 \\approx \\qty{8.5}{\\micro J}$.", "电荷以 $f_0 = 1/(2\\pi\\sqrt{LC})$ 的频率振荡，电流", "与之相差四分之一周期，能量在极板与线圈之间来回转移，总", "能量保持不变。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:4}", "$Q_0 = \\qty{2.0}{\\micro C}$; $f_0 = 1/T_0 = \\qty{250}{Hz}$;", "$q(T_0/2) = \\qty{-2.0}{\\micro C}$；$i(0) = 0$（余弦在 $t=0$ 处取极值）；", "$I_0 = 2\\pi \\times \\num{2.0e-6}/\\num{4.0e-3} \\approx \\qty{3.1}{mA}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:5}", "能量全部在电容器中时，$q = \\pm Q_0$，$i = 0$（$t = 0$、$T_0/2$、", "$T_0$、\\dots），相当于单摆的两个端点。能量全部在线圈中时，$q = 0$，", "$i = \\pm I_0$（$t = T_0/4$、$3T_0/4$、\\dots）时，相当于单摆的", "最低点，也是速度最快的点。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:6}", "$d^2q/dt^2 = -(2\\pi/T_0)^2\\,Q_0\\cos(2\\pi t/T_0) = -(2\\pi/T_0)^2 q$,", "于是 $L\\,d^2q/dt^2 + q/C = q\\,[\\,1/C - L(2\\pi/T_0)^2\\,] = 0$ 对所有 $t$", "成立，当且仅当 $(2\\pi/T_0)^2 = 1/(LC)$，即 $T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:7}", "$L = \\dfrac{1}{4\\pi^2 f_0^2 C} = \\dfrac{1}{39.5 \\times", "(\\num{1.98e5})^2 \\times \\num{2.2e-10}} \\approx \\qty{2.9}{mH}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:8}", "$E = \\tfrac12 CU_0^2 = \\qty{5.0e-5}{J}$；$\\tfrac12 LI_0^2 = E$ 得", "$I_0 = \\sqrt{2E/L} = \\sqrt{\\num{1.0e-2}} = \\qty{0.10}{A}$，首次", "出现于 $T_0/4 = \\tfrac14 \\times \\qty{0.63}{ms} \\approx", "\\qty{0.16}{ms}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:9}", "$E_C \\propto \\cos^2(2\\pi t/T_0)$，而 $\\cos^2$ 每", "\\emph{半}圈重复一次：每个周期内电容器被充满两次，故", "频率为 $2f_0$。当 $t = T_0/8$ 时，相位为 $\\pi/4$：", "$\\cos^2(\\pi/4) = \\tfrac12$，故 $E_C = E_L = E/2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:10}", "每个准周期的比值为 $3.0/4.0 = 0.75$，第六个极大值", "为 $4.0 \\times 0.75^6 \\approx \\qty{0.71}{V}$。能量 $\\propto$ 振幅", "的平方，因此每个周期约保留 $0.75^2 \\approx 56\\%$ 的能量。准周期", "仍 $\\approx T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}$：轻阻尼只使振幅减小，", "而几乎不影响振动快慢。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:11}", "$T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{0.50 \\times \\num{2.0e-5}} = 2\\pi \\times", "\\num{3.16e-3} \\approx \\qty{20}{ms}$。对应关系：$k = m/(LC) =", "0.50/\\num{1.0e-5} = \\qty{5.0e4}{N/m}$；检验：", "$2\\pi\\sqrt{m/k} = 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\num{1.0e-5}}$ --- 结果同样为 \\qty{20}{ms}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:12}", "$C = \\qty{500}{pF}$: $f_0 = 1/(2\\pi\\sqrt{\\num{1.0e-13}}) \\approx", "\\qty{0.50}{MHz}$; $C = \\qty{50}{pF}$: $f_0 \\approx \\qty{1.6}{MHz}$.", "$L$ 固定时，$f_0 = (2\\pi\\sqrt{L})^{-1} C^{-1/2} \\propto 1/\\sqrt{C}$：", "$C$ 增大十倍，只以 $\\sqrt{10} \\approx 3.2$ 倍的因子改变 $f_0$ --- 与前面结果一致。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:13}", "$0.95^n = \\tfrac12$: $n = \\ln 2/\\lvert\\ln 0.95\\rvert \\approx 13.5$,", "故约 $14$ 个周期。振幅 $\\propto \\sqrt{E}$：降至", "初始值的 $1/\\sqrt{2} \\approx 0.71$ 倍。若频率为 \\qty{1.0}{MHz}，", "$T_0 = \\qty{1.0}{\\micro s}$，约为 \\qty{14}{\\micro s}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:14}", "每周期损耗 $0.020 \\times \\qty{1.0e-9}{J} = \\qty{2.0e-11}{J}$，", "按每秒 \\num{32768} 个周期计，$P = \\num{32768} \\times \\num{2.0e-11}", "\\approx \\qty{6.6e-7}{W}$ --- 不足一微瓦，纽扣", "电池可用数年。同相推动时，只有在正确相位施力才会\\emph{增加}", "能量（共振）；反相则会阻碍摆动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rlc-oscillations:15}", "$C = \\dfrac{1}{4\\pi^2 f_0^2 L} = \\dfrac{1}{39.5 \\times", "(\\num{2.5e7})^2 \\times \\num{1.0e-6}} \\approx \\qty{41}{pF}$。电阻器", "应使回路进入非周期状态：电荷", "随后无过冲地趋于稳定 --- 既无振荡，也无振铃。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:rlc-oscillations:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 回路定律：$u_L + u_C = 0$，其中 $u_C = q/C$，", "$u_L = L\\,di/dt$, $i = dq/dt$: $L\\,d^2q/dt^2 + q/C = 0$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $d^2q/dt^2 = -(2\\pi/T_0)^2 q$，故方程化为", "$q\\,[\\,1/C - L(2\\pi/T_0)^2\\,] = 0$，对所有 $t$ 成立，当且仅当", "$T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}$.", ""]}